        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Backrooms: Reminiscence</strong>, you start your first day at <strong>NovaSync Research Institute</strong>. Your task of the day is to see the ongoing development of the second Outpost. You're expecting to meet some people in the second Outpost, but no one seems to be there. Something unexpected happens, and now you're left alone wandering the infinite hallways of The Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/766a7f389af7298c0dbbdd8d54587aca.avif?t=1761908427\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> Backrooms: Reminiscence</strong>, you play as<strong> William Smith</strong>, an employee at<strong> NovaSync Research Institute</strong>. This game is a single-player horror experience, where unexpected things happen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the immersive world through an ultra-realistic camera. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many areas of The Backrooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk</strong>, <strong>Run</strong>, <strong>Crouch,</strong> and <strong>Jump</strong> to navigate some challenging spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world. Open doors to access new areas. Turn the lights on when you come across a light switch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what <i>Backrooms: Reminiscence</i> is all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/6c4a849ae038b8b4d0fb744e85d36c1d.poster.avif?t=1761908427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/6c4a849ae038b8b4d0fb744e85d36c1d.webm?t=1761908427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/6c4a849ae038b8b4d0fb744e85d36c1d.mp4?t=1761908427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Backrooms: Reminiscence</strong>, you start your first day at <strong>NovaSync Research Institute</strong>. Your task of the day is to see the ongoing development of the second Outpost. You're expecting to meet some people in the second Outpost, but no one seems to be there. Something unexpected happens, and now you're left alone wandering the infinite hallways of The Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/766a7f389af7298c0dbbdd8d54587aca.avif?t=1761908427\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> Backrooms: Reminiscence</strong>, you play as<strong> William Smith</strong>, an employee at<strong> NovaSync Research Institute</strong>. This game is a single-player horror experience, where unexpected things happen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the immersive world through an ultra-realistic camera. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many areas of The Backrooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk</strong>, <strong>Run</strong>, <strong>Crouch,</strong> and <strong>Jump</strong> to navigate some challenging spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world. Open doors to access new areas. Turn the lights on when you come across a light switch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what <i>Backrooms: Reminiscence</i> is all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/6c4a849ae038b8b4d0fb744e85d36c1d.poster.avif?t=1761908427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/6c4a849ae038b8b4d0fb744e85d36c1d.webm?t=1761908427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919010/extras/6c4a849ae038b8b4d0fb744e85d36c1d.mp4?t=1761908427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
